## 九、4.8 综合实例：个人银行账户管理程序（初版）★★★

全书主线案例在此登场，之后每章迭代一次。简化版包含：账号、余额、存/取/显示，外加全套**构造/析构/复制构造的观察窗口** —— 这个例子本身就是一份「对象生老病死」的实况录像：

```cpp
// demo04f.cpp — 4.8 综合实例：简化版个人银行账户 Account（全书主线案例首次登场）
#include <iostream>
#include <string>
using namespace std;

class Account {
    string id_;
    double balance_;
public:
    // ---- 构造/析构：打印出来观察调用时机 ----
    Account() : Account("0000", 0.0) {              // 委托构造（C++11）
        cout << "  [default ctor via delegate]" << endl;
    }
    Account(const string &id, double bal) : id_(id), balance_(bal) {
        cout << "  [ctor " << id_ << ", balance=" << balance_ << "]" << endl;
    }
    Account(const Account &other)                   // 复制构造：参数必须是引用
        : id_(other.id_ + "_copy"), balance_(other.balance_) {
        cout << "  [copy ctor -> " << id_ << "]" << endl;
    }
    ~Account() { cout << "  [dtor " << id_ << "]" << endl; }

    // ---- 业务接口 ----
    void deposit(double amt) {
        balance_ += amt;
        cout << "  " << id_ << " deposit +" << amt << " -> " << balance_ << endl;
    }
    bool withdraw(double amt) {
        if (amt > balance_) {
            cout << "  " << id_ << " withdraw " << amt << " FAILED (balance=" << balance_ << ")" << endl;
            return false;
        }
        balance_ -= amt;
        cout << "  " << id_ << " withdraw -" << amt << " -> " << balance_ << endl;
        return true;
    }
    void show() const {
        cout << "  Account " << id_ << "  balance = " << balance_ << endl;
    }
};

void SnapshotByValue(Account a) { a.show(); }       // 传值形参 → 复制构造时机②

int main() {
    cout << "== open accounts ==" << endl;
    Account a1("6222", 100.0);
    Account a2;                                     // 默认构造（委托）

    cout << "== operations ==" << endl;
    a1.deposit(50.0);
    a1.withdraw(30.0);
    a1.withdraw(500.0);                             // 余额不足，被拦下
    a1.show();
    a2.show();

    cout << "== pass by value (copy fires) ==" << endl;
    SnapshotByValue(a1);                            // 复制构造时机②

    cout << "== copy initialize ==" << endl;
    Account a3 = a1;                                // 复制构造时机①

    cout << "== main ends (dtors: a3, a2, a1) ==" << endl;
    return 0;
}
```

真实输出（g++ 14.2.0 实跑）：

```text
== open accounts ==
  [ctor 6222, balance=100]
  [ctor 0000, balance=0]
  [default ctor via delegate]
== operations ==
  6222 deposit +50 -> 150
  6222 withdraw -30 -> 120
  6222 withdraw 500 FAILED (balance=120)
  Account 6222  balance = 120
  Account 0000  balance = 0
== pass by value (copy fires) ==
  [copy ctor -> 6222_copy]
  Account 6222_copy  balance = 120
  [dtor 6222_copy]
== copy initialize ==
  [copy ctor -> 6222_copy]
== main ends (dtors: a3, a2, a1) ==
  [dtor 6222_copy]
  [dtor 0000]
  [dtor 6222]
```

逐段拆解这份「实况录像」：

1. **委托构造的顺序**：`[ctor 0000...]` 先于 `[default ctor via delegate]` —— 被委托者（含初始化列表）先跑完，委托者函数体后跑；
2. **业务拦截**：`withdraw(500)` 余额不足返回 false —— 错误用**返回值**表达，这是第 3 讲 C 组「bool + 正常路径」风格的落地；
3. **传值快照**：SnapshotByValue 里凭空多出 `6222_copy`，函数一结束立刻析构 —— 时机②的完整生灭，也再次警告大对象别传值；
4. **析构倒放**：a3 → a2 → a1，与构造严格相反；快照的析构**不在这个序列里**，因为它死在函数结束的当口。


